Infinity Qwen3.5 dense text and OneJev additions

Original Infinity Rust host ownership/executor/layout code and new original
port contributions use Infinity Restricted MIT License 1.0 in the repository
LICENSE. The inherited grants below remain unchanged; this is not a relicensing
of the inherited material.

