complete original Hugging Face Team copyright and permission notices inline.
The native BF16 packed mean port in device/src/packed_mean_bf16.rs follows the
retained Candle packed_mean_pool kernel; its origin is recorded in that file
and backends/libtorch/cpp/vendor/candle_kernels/PROVENANCE.md.

